<p>Decimal 36873. Read only. Also known as <strong>VICCR9</strong>.</p>
<p>Position of the Y potentiometer of a paddle plugged into the control port.
Turned fully one way it reads 0, fully the other way 255. It also reads 255 when
no paddle is connected, so it cannot be used to detect one.</p>
<p>See also XPADDLE_REGISTER ($9008) for the first potentiometer.</p>
